Dear Sir or Madam:

This firm requests a plain (uncertified) copy of the initial Certificate of
Incorporation filed with your office on behalf of the entity identified below.
The filing appears on the Department's public corporation and business entity
database, but the document image is not available for download through the
online portal. We therefore submit this written request for manual fulfillmen=
t.

The document is identified as follows:

  Entity Name:            EDUCATION ADVOCACY SERVICES, INC.
  DOS ID Number:          2324173
  Date of Incorporation:  December 11, 1998
  County of Record:       Kings
  Document Requested:     Initial Certificate of Incorporation
  File Number:            981211000178
  Document Length:        6 pages
  Copy Type Requested:    Plain (uncertified) copy

FEE AND PAYMENT
The Department's flat fee for a plain copy is $5.00 (a certified copy is
$10.00). Payment in the amount of $5.00 is being tendered by [check / money
order] made payable to the NYS Department of State, mailed together with a
signed original of this request on firm letterhead to the Albany address abov=
e.
A completed NYS DOS Credit Card/Debit Card Authorization Form is enclosed in
the alternative if you prefer to process payment by card. If the correct fee
differs from the amount tendered, kindly contact the undersigned before
returning the request and the balance will be remitted promptly.

RETURN INSTRUCTIONS
Please mail the copy to the attention of the undersigned at the firm's address
below.

  Contact:            Zeesy Kessler, Legal Administrator
  Firm:               The Zweig Law Firm, P.C.
  Mailing Address:    [Street Address, Suite]
                      [City], New York [ZIP]
  Daytime Telephone:  [(___) ___-____]
  Email Address:      zkessler@zweigpc.com

